<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5543" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">bombȳcĭnus</span></b> , a,
		um, adj.
		bombyx, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>of silk</i>, <i>silken</i> (cf. sericus): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vestis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					11, 22, 26, § 76</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">panniculus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Juv.
					6, 260</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">taenia,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Mart.
					14, 24</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Dig. 34, 2, 23, §
				1</span></i>.—<i>Subst.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">bombȳcĭna</span></b> ,
				ōrum, n., <i>silk garments</i>, <i><span class="en">Mart. 11, 50, 5</span></i>; <i><span class="en">8, 68, 7</span></i>;
					<i><span class="en">App. M. 8, p. 214,
			6</span></i>.—And <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">bombȳcĭnum</span></b> , i,
				n., <i>a silk texture</i> or <i>web</i>, <i><span class="en">Isid. Orig. 19, 22,
				13</span></i>.</div>
